See secr-habitatmasks.pdf <http://www.otago.ac.nz/density/pdfs/secr-habitatmasks.pdf> for discussion of mask spacing (pixel size). Certainly you need to set the spacing with care when using clustered detectors. 1/32 HR size is probably not too far out, but you need to confirm that using plots like Fig. 5 in the pdf.

There is not enough information to diagnose your contour problem. Increase nx in pdot.contour for a prettier picture (e.g., nx=128 or nx=256).

Murray

